<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end June.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end June.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa in store as of the end of June/early July. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		    Total	     Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	530,000	    30,212.598 (inc 7,483.627 forw sales)</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN 128,000	    15,508.418</p>
<p>ANTWERP	  126,943	    1,449.828 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS)  55,750</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM	 13,750	    2,190.095 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>The following are changes on month earlier levels:</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM    DOWN 39,000</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN DOWN 8,250</p>
<p>ANTWERP DOWN 6,060</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS) DOWN 4,250</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM DOWN 790</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
